work (ADR-0013, hypergumbo_tracker.cli, tracker tests) filed in the main
changelog. Moved to packages/hypergumbo-tracker/CHANGELOG.md, whose
Unreleased section was empty, and condensed to that document's granularity.

Phase 1 (completeness): checked all 249 non-tracker commits since v7.0.0
against the section. One gap found and filled — SCHEMA_VERSION 0.20.0 ->
0.20.1 (Symbol.span becoming Optional[Span]) was undocumented; the change
itself was described but its schema transition was not.

